"A和B选项最后得到的造型为西瓜-a，C选项最后得到的造型为西瓜-b。","auto":true},{"no":13,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"一块豆腐平放着按照下图所示的方式切4刀，我们会得到几块豆腐？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221014/16657204414046.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：4"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：6"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：8"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：9"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"根据图示数出图中被线分成的区域，一共有8块区域，故选项C正确。","auto":true},{"no":14,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"执行以下程序后，关于小青蛙的描述正确的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221014/16657205471254.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221014/16657205586708.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：小青蛙叫一声“呱”之后，向前走50步"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：小青蛙一边叫一声“呱”一边向前走50步"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：小青蛙先向前走50步之后，再叫一声“呱”"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：小青蛙原地不动"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"播放声音积木：声音开始播放的同时，立刻执行后面的程序，因此运行积木块之后的效果是小青蛙一边叫一声“呱”一边向前走50步。","auto":true},{"no":15,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"画架的造型如下图所示，小丽拿着画架去室外画画时，以下哪个积木块运行一次就可以看到小丽最终画的效果（造型Easel-c）？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221014/16657207208499.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221014/16657207322294.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221014/16657207657748.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221014/16657207758713.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221014/16657207857904.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221014/16657207965102.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"A选项最后的造型为Easel-a，B和D选项最后的造型为Easel-b。","auto":true},{"no":16,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"点击下面哪个按钮可以停止程序运行？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/file